        <mxCell id="rules" value="KEY RULES&#10;Online: provider confirmation (F14). Advance cash: record the full amount actually received at FMRC before production.&#10;Only Admin may correct an eligible cash receipt or issue a custom cash refund; these are auditable separate actions.&#10;Paid work is not silently rewritten. Close and reconcile the existing order before a new quotation." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#273142;fontFamily=Montserrat;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
